OL,3,BVideo: Meet Teemu, a 17-year-old who's 
OL,4,Bbaking up a business                   
OL,5,GTeemu Ahonen bakes up to 50 rye loaves 
OL,6,Gevery other Sunday at his family home  
OL,7,Gin Central Finland.                    
OL,8,K                                       
OL,9,BFinland extends 'pushback' law to repel
OL,10,Binstrumentalised migration             
OL,11,GThe law lets Finnish border guards turn
OL,12,Gback asylum seekers.                   
OL,13,K                                       
OL,14,BSome Finns drive hundreds of kilometres
OL,15,Bfor textured hair care                 
OL,16,GYou can become a hairdresser in Finland
OL,17,Gwithout ever working with anything but 
OL,18,GScandinavian hair.                     
